{"sha":"5ebe8d315062c7db0855bfa760a0379012a51743","node_id":"C_kwDOQ07FcNoAKDVlYmU4ZDMxNTA2MmM3ZGIwODU1YmZhNzYwYTAzNzkwMTJhNTE3NDM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/git/commits/5ebe8d315062c7db0855bfa760a0379012a51743","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/commit/5ebe8d315062c7db0855bfa760a0379012a51743","author":{"name":"Christophe Henner","email":"christophehenner@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-16T00:44:17Z"},"committer":{"name":"Christophe Henner","email":"christophehenner@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-16T00:44:17Z"},"tree":{"sha":"0ae19379893f10b6e3499c60a29f2252129019de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/git/trees/0ae19379893f10b6e3499c60a29f2252129019de"},"message":"fix(contracts): bind local file identity state\n\nProblem\nRaw FileId maps could be paired with a different project, extensions could change descriptor IDs on re-encoding, and callers could forge transition change lists. ContributionRevision also used a digest RecordId as the logical ContributionId.\n\nDecision\nCarry FileId maps in opaque project and snapshot-bound state, expose transition fields read-only, reject unsupported descriptor extensions, and give logical contributions a separate contrib: identifier plus an explicit legacy capture-record link.\n\nRationale\nThe Local experimental profile must preserve identity ownership and immutable revision relationships without accepting caller-asserted mappings or silently changing record digests.\n\nValidation\nrustfmt --edition 2024 on the changed contract files; git diff --check. Cargo/build/runtime tests were not run under the current lease.","parents":[{"sha":"63a3aa3e533ba466f02f1deabd36b9d3feb88985","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/git/commits/63a3aa3e533ba466f02f1deabd36b9d3feb88985","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/commit/63a3aa3e533ba466f02f1deabd36b9d3feb88985"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}}